+# Sefaria link rows whose one side names the wrong segment (SefariaLinkCitationCorrections).
+# Columns (tab-separated): the side that stays, the wrong side as Sefaria exports it, the reviewed replacement.
+# A replacement needs textual evidence on both sides; a range gets link_range and link_coverage.
+#
+# Otzaria/otzaria#4023: the Ramban's dibbur "א"ה מאי איריא אבן אפי' דינר נמי" explains
+# "אי הכי," (Shabbat 141b:28) and "מאי איריא אבן, אפילו דינר נמי!..." (Shabbat 142a:1), not
+# "...מאי איריא רפוי? אפילו לא רפוי נמי!" (Shabbat 141b:16), where Sefaria anchors it.
+# https://www.sefaria.org/Chiddushei_Ramban_on_Shabbat.141b.2
+# https://www.sefaria.org/Shabbat.141b.28-142a.1
+Chiddushei Ramban on Shabbat 141b:2	Shabbat 141b:16	Shabbat 141b:28-142a:1
